{
  "id": "RAW_744746aed8",
  "title": "Anthropic 发布 Claude Opus 5.5：Fable 5.1 级性能，运行成本仅为 Opus 5 的 40%",
  "url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/09/22/anthropic-claude-opus-5-5-release/",
  "date": "2026-09-23 02:59:38",
  "author": "Asif Razzaq",
  "siteName": "MarkTechPost",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Anthropic has released <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-opus-5-5\">Claude Opus 5.5</a>, the first model in its new Claude 5.5 family. The team states it performs at the level of Claude Fable 5.1 on most work. It also costs 40% less to run than Opus 5 on typical workloads at default settings. On Anthropic’s own benchmarks, it leads in agentic coding, computer use, and knowledge work.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Is it deployable?</strong> Yes, as a managed API model. Anthropic has not released weights, so self-hosting is not an option. Developers can call <code>claude-opus-5-5</code> on the <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/overview\">Claude Platform</a>, <a href=\"https://claude.com/partners/claude-on-aws\">Amazon Web Services</a>, <a href=\"https://claude.com/partners/google-cloud-vertex-ai\">Google Cloud</a>, and <a href=\"https://claude.com/partners/microsoft-foundry\">Microsoft Azure</a>. Zero data retention is available, as with previous Opus models.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-benchmarks-strong-lead-not-a-clean-sweep\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benchmarks: Strong Lead, Not a Clean Sweep</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Opus 5.5 scores use adaptive thinking at max effort, with production safeguards enabled.</p>\n  <figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\n   <table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Benchmark</th>\n      <th>Opus 5.5</th>\n      <th>Fable 5.1</th>\n      <th>Opus 5</th>\n      <th>GPT-6 Astra</th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Terminal-Bench 4.0</td>\n      <td>66.4%</td>\n      <td>55.8%</td>\n      <td>52.3%</td>\n      <td>57.9%</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>FrontierCode v1.1</td>\n      <td>54.4%</td>\n      <td>50.3%</td>\n      <td>48.0%</td>\n      <td>53.3%</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>CursorBench 4.0</td>\n      <td>57.8%</td>\n      <td>51.8%</td>\n      <td>46.6%</td>\n      <td>n/r</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>GDPval-AA v2.1 (Elo)</td>\n      <td>1846</td>\n      <td>1735</td>\n      <td>1708</td>\n      <td>1542</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>OSWorld 2.0</td>\n      <td>81.8%</td>\n      <td>80.7%</td>\n      <td>74.0%</td>\n      <td>n/r</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1</td>\n      <td>58.7%</td>\n      <td>52.6%</td>\n      <td>29.0%</td>\n      <td>64.6%</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>AutomationBench</td>\n      <td>40.0%</td>\n      <td>31.4%</td>\n      <td>26.9%</td>\n      <td>41.4%</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </figure>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Terminal-Bench 4.0 is reported at xhigh effort for Opus 5.5. GPT-6 Astra still leads on Terminal-Bench-Science and AutomationBench. Zapier ran AutomationBench without fallback models, so safeguard interventions counted as failures. Anthropic also cautions that benchmark margins are becoming a less reliable guide. In its own use, the gap to Fable 5.1 is narrower than the scores suggest.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The cost-adjusted results are more telling. At default (medium) effort, Opus 5.5 scores 54.6% on FrontierCode. That beats GPT-6 Astra’s top score of 53.3% at about a fifth of the cost per task. On CursorBench, medium effort scores 52.5%. That is 11 points above GPT-5.6 Sol’s best, at about a third of the cost.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-pricing-and-speed\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pricing and Speed</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Opus 5.5 needs less compute to serve than Opus 5, and pricing reflects that.</p>\n  <figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\n   <table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Per 1M tokens</th>\n      <th>Opus 5.5</th>\n      <th>Opus 5</th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Input</td>\n      <td>$4</td>\n      <td>$5</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Output</td>\n      <td>$20</td>\n      <td>$25</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Cache reads</td>\n      <td>$0.20</td>\n      <td>$0.50</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Cache writes</td>\n      <td>$5</td>\n      <td>$6.25</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </figure>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cache reads make up most agentic and coding costs, and they drop 60%. Opus 5.5 also uses fewer tokens per task. Together, that nets out to the 40% cost reduction. Output generation is more than 30% faster than Opus 5. Fast mode in Claude Code and the Claude Platform offers up to 2.5x speed at $8 input and $40 output per million tokens.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Anthropic is also raising five-hour usage limits on Pro, Max, Team, and seat-based Enterprise plans. Subscribers get a rate limit reset they can save and use later.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-what-early-testers-reported\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Early Testers Reported</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>One tester completed a 680,000-line code migration in less than a day.</li>\n   <li>Another audited and fixed a 200,000-line codebase in under 3 hours. Opus 5 took over 20 hours and 2.5x the tokens.</li>\n   <li>In an internal C to Rust port of HAProxy, Opus 5.5 finished in 9.5 hours. Fable 5.1 took 12 hours, and Opus 5.5 cost 51% less.</li>\n   <li>Deloitte says Opus 5.5 at lowest effort caught 72% of known review bugs. Opus 5 at high effort caught 56%.</li>\n   <li>In a hard-to-source earnings report test, 16 of 18 Opus 5.5 reports cleared Anthropic’s quality bar. Fable 5.1 and Opus 5 never did.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Writing style also changed. Opus 5.5 puts key information first, uses less jargon, and follows the writing rules you give it.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-safety-safeguards-and-api-changes\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Safety, Safeguards, and API Changes</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Opus 5.5 is Anthropic’s first release since CEO Dario Amodei called for <a href=\"https://darioamodei.com/post/we-must-pace-the-frontier\">pacing the frontier</a>. External evaluators including <a href=\"https://metr.org/\">METR</a> and <a href=\"https://www.imaginefrontier.com/\">Frontier Design</a> tested it before release. It posts the best score to date on Anthropic’s automated behavioral audit, which covers nearly 2,000 scenarios. In a new containment test, it tried to circumvent boundaries about 85% less often than Opus 5. Anthropic also notes the model often suspects it is being evaluated.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Its biology and cyber capabilities are comparable to Claude Mythos 5.1. <strong>So Opus 5.5 ships with safeguards similar to Fable 5.1:</strong></p>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li><strong>Cybersecurity:</strong> Routine bug finding and fixing works. Most other cybersecurity tasks are re-routed to Opus 4.8. The <a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14604842-real-time-cyber-safeguards-on-claude-opus-and-sonnet\">Cyber Verification Program</a> will expand to Opus 5.5.</li>\n   <li><strong>Biology:</strong> Vetted organizations can apply to the <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/life-sciences-verification-program\">Life Sciences Verification Program</a>.</li>\n   <li><strong>Distillation:</strong> <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/preserved-thinking\">Preserved thinking</a> stops API users from editing prior context to extract reasoning. It applies to API accounts created on or after August 31, 2026.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Two more changes affect integrations. <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/whats-new-opus-5-5#thinking-cant-be-disabled\">Thinking can no longer be disabled</a>. Outputs also carry <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-text-watermark\">watermarking</a> for EU AI Act compliance. Full details are in the <a href=\"https://anthropic.com/claude-opus-5-5-system-card\">Opus 5.5 System Card</a>.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-interactive-explainer\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Interactive Explainer</strong></h2>\n  <div id=\"mtp-o55-wrap\" style=\"max-width:800px!important;margin:24px auto!important;background:#FAF9F5!important;border:1px solid #E3DFD3!important;border-radius:10px!important;overflow:hidden!important;\">\n   <iframe class=\"lazyload\" id=\"mtp-o55-frame\" title=\"Claude Opus 5.5 interactive explainer\" srcdoc=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;\n&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;\n&lt;title&gt;Claude Opus 5.5 explained | Marktechpost&lt;/title&gt;\n&lt;link rel=&quot;preconnect&quot; href=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com&quot;&gt;\n&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,500;6..72,600&amp;family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap&quot;&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n:root{\n  --ink:#141413; --ink2:#3D3D3A; --ivory:#FAF9F5; --paper:#F0EEE6; --line:#E3DFD3;\n  --clay:#D97757; --clay-deep:#B85A3B; --sky:#6A9BCC; --olive:#788C5D; --slate:#B0AEA5; --mtp:#76B900;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--ink)}\nbody{font-family:&quot;Instrument Sans&quot;,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55}\n#mtp-o55{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 20px 16px}\n#mtp-o55 h2{font-family:&quot;Newsreader&quot;,Georgia,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-weight:600;font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n#mtp-o55 .lede{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--ink2);max-width:62ch}\n#mtp-o55 .tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:18px;overflow-x:auto}\n#mtp-o55 .tab{appearance:none;border:0;background:none;font:inherit;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink2);padding:10px 12px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-1px;white-space:nowrap}\n#mtp-o55 .tab[aria-selected=&quot;true&quot;]{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--clay)}\n#mtp-o55 button:focus-visible,#mtp-o55 input:focus-visible,#mtp-o55 a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:2px}\n#mtp-o55 .panel[hidden]{display:none}\n#mtp-o55 .hint{font-size:13px;color:#6b6a64;margin:10px 0 0}\n#mtp-o55 a{color:var(--clay-deep)}\n/* presets and chips */\n#mtp-o55 .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:0 0 16px}\n#mtp-o55 .chip{appearance:none;font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;cursor:pointer}\n#mtp-o55 .chip[aria-pressed=&quot;true&quot;]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ivory);border-color:var(--ink)}\n/* cost */\n#mtp-o55 .sliders{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px 22px;margin-bottom:18px}\n#mtp-o55 .sl label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n#mtp-o55 .sl output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink2)}\n#mtp-o55 input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--clay)}\n#mtp-o55 .meter{margin:6px 0 4px}\n#mtp-o55 .mrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:88px 1fr 84px;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:8px 0}\n#mtp-o55 .mname{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\n#mtp-o55 .track{height:26px;background:var(--paper);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;display:flex}\n#mtp-o55 .seg{height:100%;width:0;transition:width .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n#mtp-o55 .mval{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}\n#mtp-o55 .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);margin:8px 0 0 98px}\n#mtp-o55 .legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-1px}\n#mtp-o55 .save{font-family:&quot;Newsreader&quot;,Georgia,serif;font-size:24px;margin:14px 0 0}\n#mtp-o55 .save b{color:var(--clay-deep)}\n/* bench */\n#mtp-o55 .brow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:104px 1fr 64px;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:7px 0}\n#mtp-o55 .bname{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n#mtp-o55 .btrack{height:22px;background:var(--paper);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}\n#mtp-o55 .bbar{height:100%;width:0;border-radius:4px;transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n#mtp-o55 .bval{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\n#mtp-o55 .bval.nr{color:#8d8b84;font-weight:500;font-size:12px}\n#mtp-o55 .note{background:var(--paper);border-left:3px solid var(--clay);padding:10px 12px;margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}\n/* routing */\n#mtp-o55 svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n#mtp-o55 .nd rect{fill:var(--paper);stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:1.5;transition:fill .3s,stroke .3s}\n#mtp-o55 .nd text{font-family:&quot;Instrument Sans&quot;,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;fill:var(--ink)}\n#mtp-o55 .nd.on rect{fill:#F6E1D8;stroke:var(--clay)}\n#mtp-o55 .wire{fill:none;stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:2;transition:stroke .3s}\n#mtp-o55 .wire.on{stroke:var(--clay)}\n#mtp-o55 .outcome{margin-top:12px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:#fff}\n#mtp-o55 .outcome h3{font-family:&quot;Newsreader&quot;,Georgia,serif;font-size:19px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600}\n#mtp-o55 .outcome p{margin:0 0 6px}\n#mtp-o55 .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:20px;padding-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#6b6a64}\n#mtp-o55 .foot .brand{color:var(--mtp);font-weight:600}\n@media (max-width:640px){\n  #mtp-o55{padding:16px 12px 12px}\n  #mtp-o55 h2{font-size:24px}\n  #mtp-o55 .sliders{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  #mtp-o55 .mrow{grid-template-columns:70px 1fr 72px}\n  #mtp-o55 .legend{margin-left:0}\n  #mtp-o55 .brow{grid-template-columns:86px 1fr 54px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  #mtp-o55 .seg,#mtp-o55 .bbar,#mtp-o55 .nd rect,#mtp-o55 .wire{transition:none}\n}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n&lt;div id=&quot;mtp-o55&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Claude Opus 5.5, explained&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p class=&quot;lede&quot;&gt;Reprice your own workload, compare published scores, and trace how the new safeguards route a request. All figures come from Anthropic's launch post of September 22, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;tabs&quot; role=&quot;tablist&quot; aria-label=&quot;Explainer sections&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; role=&quot;tab&quot; id=&quot;t-cost&quot; aria-controls=&quot;p-cost&quot; aria-selected=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Price a workload&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; role=&quot;tab&quot; id=&quot;t-bench&quot; aria-controls=&quot;p-bench&quot; aria-selected=&quot;false&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;Benchmarks&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; role=&quot;tab&quot; id=&quot;t-route&quot; aria-controls=&quot;p-route&quot; aria-selected=&quot;false&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;Safeguard routing&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;!-- COST --&gt;\n  &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;p-cost&quot; role=&quot;tabpanel&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;t-cost&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;chips&quot; id=&quot;presets&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;true&quot; data-p=&quot;20,5,200,10&quot;&gt;Agentic coding (cache heavy)&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot; data-p=&quot;50,10,0,0&quot;&gt;Chat app, no caching&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot; data-p=&quot;10,20,20,2&quot;&gt;Long report writing&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;sliders&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;sl&quot;&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;s-in&quot;&gt;Input tokens / month &lt;output id=&quot;o-in&quot;&gt;&lt;/output&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;range&quot; id=&quot;s-in&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;200&quot; step=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;sl&quot;&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;s-out&quot;&gt;Output tokens / month &lt;output id=&quot;o-out&quot;&gt;&lt;/output&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;range&quot; id=&quot;s-out&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;100&quot; step=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;sl&quot;&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;s-cr&quot;&gt;Cache reads / month &lt;output id=&quot;o-cr&quot;&gt;&lt;/output&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;range&quot; id=&quot;s-cr&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;500&quot; step=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;sl&quot;&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;s-cw&quot;&gt;Cache writes / month &lt;output id=&quot;o-cw&quot;&gt;&lt;/output&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;range&quot; id=&quot;s-cw&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;50&quot; step=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;meter&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;mrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mname&quot;&gt;Opus 5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;track&quot; id=&quot;tr-old&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mval&quot; id=&quot;v-old&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;mrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mname&quot;&gt;Opus 5.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;track&quot; id=&quot;tr-new&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mval&quot; id=&quot;v-new&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;legend&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background:#141413&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Input&lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background:#D97757&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Output&lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background:#6A9BCC&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Cache reads&lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background:#788C5D&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Cache writes&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;save&quot; id=&quot;save&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;hint&quot;&gt;Uses list prices per 1M tokens (Opus 5.5: $4 input, $20 output, $0.20 cache reads, $5 cache writes. Opus 5: $5, $25, $0.50, $6.25). This holds token counts equal. Anthropic's 40% figure also counts Opus 5.5 using fewer tokens per task.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n\n  &lt;!-- BENCH --&gt;\n  &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;p-bench&quot; role=&quot;tabpanel&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;t-bench&quot; hidden&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;chips&quot; id=&quot;bchips&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div id=&quot;bars&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;note&quot; id=&quot;bnote&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;hint&quot;&gt;Opus 5.5 scores use adaptive thinking at max effort unless noted, with production safeguards on. &quot;Not reported&quot; means Anthropic's table lists no score.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n\n  &lt;!-- ROUTE --&gt;\n  &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;p-route&quot; role=&quot;tabpanel&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;t-route&quot; hidden&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;chips&quot; id=&quot;rchips&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 480 250&quot; role=&quot;img&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;rt-title&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;title id=&quot;rt-title&quot;&gt;Request routing diagram for Claude Opus 5.5 safeguards&lt;/title&gt;\n      &lt;path class=&quot;wire&quot; id=&quot;w0&quot; d=&quot;M105 125 L165 125&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;path class=&quot;wire&quot; id=&quot;wA&quot; d=&quot;M285 125 C318 125 318 45 343 45&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;path class=&quot;wire&quot; id=&quot;wB&quot; d=&quot;M285 125 L343 125&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;path class=&quot;wire&quot; id=&quot;wC&quot; d=&quot;M285 125 C318 125 318 205 343 205&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;g class=&quot;nd&quot; id=&quot;nR&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;5&quot; y=&quot;100&quot; width=&quot;100&quot; height=&quot;50&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;55&quot; y=&quot;130&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12.5px&quot;&gt;Your request&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;g class=&quot;nd&quot; id=&quot;nS&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;165&quot; y=&quot;98&quot; width=&quot;120&quot; height=&quot;54&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;225&quot; y=&quot;121&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;Opus 5.5&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;225&quot; y=&quot;139&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; style=&quot;font-weight:500;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;safeguard check&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;g class=&quot;nd&quot; id=&quot;nA&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;350&quot; y=&quot;20&quot; width=&quot;126&quot; height=&quot;50&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;413&quot; y=&quot;50&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12.5px&quot;&gt;Opus 5.5 answers&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;g class=&quot;nd&quot; id=&quot;nB&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;350&quot; y=&quot;100&quot; width=&quot;126&quot; height=&quot;50&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;413&quot; y=&quot;130&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12.5px&quot;&gt;Fallback model&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;g class=&quot;nd&quot; id=&quot;nC&quot;&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;350&quot; y=&quot;180&quot; width=&quot;126&quot; height=&quot;50&quot; rx=&quot;8&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;413&quot; y=&quot;210&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12.5px&quot;&gt;Edit stopped&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;circle id=&quot;dot&quot; r=&quot;6&quot; fill=&quot;#D97757&quot; cx=&quot;105&quot; cy=&quot;125&quot; opacity=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;\n    &lt;/svg&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;outcome&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;oh&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;op&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ou&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;foot&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/claude-opus-5-5&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Anthropic, Introducing Claude Opus 5.5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;brand&quot;&gt;Built by Marktechpost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;script&gt;\n(function(){\n  var root=document.getElementById('mtp-o55');\n  var reduce=window.matchMedia&amp;&amp;window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  function resize(){try{parent.postMessage({mtpFrame:'mtp-o55',h:document.body.offsetHeight+40},'*');}catch(e){}}\n\n  /* tabs */\n  var tabs=[].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.tab'));\n  function sel(t){\n    tabs.forEach(function(x){var on=x===t;x.setAttribute('aria-selected',on);x.tabIndex=on?0:-1;document.getElementById(x.getAttribute('aria-controls')).hidden=!on;});\n    if(t.id==='t-bench')drawBench(curB);\n    if(t.id==='t-route')runRoute(curR);\n    setTimeout(resize,60);\n  }\n  tabs.forEach(function(t,i){\n    t.addEventListener('click',function(){sel(t);});\n    t.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n      if(e.key==='ArrowRight'||e.key==='ArrowLeft'){var n=tabs[(i+(e.key==='ArrowRight'?1:tabs.length-1))%tabs.length];n.focus();sel(n);}\n    });\n  });\n\n  /* cost */\n  var P5={i:5,o:25,cr:0.5,cw:6.25}, P55={i:4,o:20,cr:0.2,cw:5};\n  var cols=['#141413','#D97757','#6A9BCC','#788C5D'];\n  var ids=['in','out','cr','cw'];\n  function mk(tr){var h='';cols.forEach(function(c){h+='&lt;div class=&quot;seg&quot; style=&quot;background:'+c+'&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;';});tr.innerHTML=h;return tr.children;}\n  var segOld=mk(document.getElementById('tr-old')), segNew=mk(document.getElementById('tr-new'));\n  function money(v){return '$'+(v&gt;=1000?Math.round(v).toLocaleString('en-US'):v.toFixed(2));}\n  function upd(){\n    var v=ids.map(function(k){var x=+document.getElementById('s-'+k).value;document.getElementById('o-'+k).textContent=x+'M';return x;});\n    var a=[v[0]*P5.i,v[1]*P5.o,v[2]*P5.cr,v[3]*P5.cw], b=[v[0]*P55.i,v[1]*P55.o,v[2]*P55.cr,v[3]*P55.cw];\n    var ta=a.reduce(function(s,x){return s+x},0), tb=b.reduce(function(s,x){return s+x},0);\n    for(var k=0;k&lt;4;k++){segOld[k].style.width=(ta?a[k]/ta*100:0)+'%';segNew[k].style.width=(ta?b[k]/ta*100:0)+'%';}\n    document.getElementById('v-old').textContent=money(ta);\n    document.getElementById('v-new').textContent=money(tb);\n    document.getElementById('save').innerHTML=ta?'Opus 5.5 costs &lt;b&gt;'+Math.round((1-tb/ta)*100)+'% less&lt;/b&gt; for this token mix.':'Move a slider to price a workload.';\n  }\n  ids.forEach(function(k){document.getElementById('s-'+k).addEventListener('input',function(){pre.forEach(function(p){p.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});upd();});});\n  var pre=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#presets .chip'));\n  function applyPreset(btn){pre.forEach(function(p){p.setAttribute('aria-pressed',p===btn)});btn.dataset.p.split(',').forEach(function(x,i){document.getElementById('s-'+ids[i]).value=x;});upd();}\n  pre.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){applyPreset(b);});});\n\n  /* benchmarks */\n  var M=[['Opus 5.5','#D97757'],['Fable 5.1','#3D3D3A'],['Opus 5','#B0AEA5'],['GPT-6 Astra','#6A9BCC'],['GPT-5.6 Sol','#788C5D']];\n  var B=[\n    {n:'Terminal-Bench 4.0',u:'%',v:[66.4,55.8,52.3,57.9,37.3],t:'Agentic coding in a terminal. Opus 5.5 reported at xhigh effort, GPT-6 Astra at high effort per OpenAI. At default effort, Opus 5.5 matches GPT-6 Astra at about 40% of the cost.'},\n    {n:'FrontierCode v1.1',u:'%',v:[54.4,50.3,48.0,53.3,47.5],t:'Measures whether an agent\\'s code changes would be merged. At default (medium) effort Opus 5.5 scores 54.6%, beating GPT-6 Astra\\'s top 53.3% for about a fifth of the cost per task.'},\n    {n:'CursorBench 4.0',u:'%',v:[57.8,51.8,46.6,null,41.7],t:'Ambiguous multi-file tasks from real Cursor sessions. At default (medium) effort Opus 5.5 scores 52.5%, about 11 points above GPT-5.6 Sol\\'s top score for about a third of the cost.'},\n    {n:'GDPval-AA v2.1',u:'Elo',v:[1846,1735,1708,1542,1588],min:1200,max:1900,t:'Real-world professional work across 44 occupations, run by Artificial Analysis. Axis starts at 1200 Elo. At default effort, Opus 5.5 beats GPT-6 Astra at max effort for about a fifth of the cost per task.'},\n    {n:'AutomationBench',u:'%',v:[40.0,31.4,26.9,41.4,28.8],t:'Business workflows across connected apps, run by Zapier. GPT-6 Astra leads here. Runs used no fallback models, so safeguard interventions counted as failures for Opus 5.5.'},\n    {n:'Humanity\\'s Last Exam',u:'%',v:[67.7,65.6,63.6,57.2,null],t:'Multidisciplinary reasoning, with tools.'},\n    {n:'Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1',u:'%',v:[58.7,52.6,29.0,64.6,22.4],t:'Agentic scientific research. GPT-6 Astra leads here. Standard error is 3.5 to 5 points per model.'},\n    {n:'OSWorld 2.0',u:'%',v:[81.8,80.7,74.0,null,null],t:'Computer use, partial-credit scoring.'},\n    {n:'Chartography',u:'%',v:[89.0,88.4,83.4,null,null],t:'Visual chart recognition, with tools.'}\n  ];\n  var curB=0, bch=document.getElementById('bchips'), bars=document.getElementById('bars');\n  B.forEach(function(b,i){var c=document.createElement('button');c.className='chip';c.textContent=b.n;c.setAttribute('aria-pressed',i===0);c.addEventListener('click',function(){curB=i;drawBench(i);});bch.appendChild(c);});\n  var h='';M.forEach(function(m,i){h+='&lt;div class=&quot;brow&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;bname&quot;&gt;'+m[0]+'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;btrack&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bbar&quot; style=&quot;background:'+m[1]+'&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;bval&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;';});bars.innerHTML=h;\n  function drawBench(i){\n    var b=B[i], lo=b.min||0, hi=b.max||100;\n    [].slice.call(bch.children).forEach(function(c,k){c.setAttribute('aria-pressed',k===i)});\n    var rows=bars.children;\n    for(var k=0;k&lt;rows.length;k++){\n      var val=b.v[k], bar=rows[k].querySelector('.bbar'), out=rows[k].querySelector('.bval');\n      if(!reduce){bar.style.transition='none';bar.style.width='0';void bar.offsetWidth;bar.style.transition='';}\n      if(val===null){bar.style.width='0';out.textContent='Not reported';out.className='bval nr';}\n      else{bar.style.width=Math.max(0,(val-lo)/(hi-lo)*100)+'%';out.textContent=b.u==='%'?val.toFixed(1)+'%':val;out.className='bval';}\n    }\n    document.getElementById('bnote').textContent=b.t;\n    setTimeout(resize,60);\n  }\n\n  /* routing */\n  var R=[\n    {n:'Routine coding task',to:'A',h:'Opus 5.5 answers',p:'Everyday software work runs on Opus 5.5 directly.',u:''},\n    {n:'Fix a bug in your code',to:'A',h:'Opus 5.5 answers',p:'Finding and fixing bugs in your own code stays allowed as part of the routine development lifecycle.',u:''},\n    {n:'Other cybersecurity task',to:'B',h:'Re-routed to Claude Opus 4.8',p:'Opus 5.5 gets cyber safeguards similar to Fable 5.1. Most cybersecurity tasks are re-routed to Opus 4.8 transparently.',u:'Unlock path: the &lt;a href=&quot;https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14604842-real-time-cyber-safeguards-on-claude-opus-and-sonnet&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Cyber Verification Program&lt;/a&gt; expands to Opus 5.5 in the coming weeks.'},\n    {n:'Restricted biology R&amp;D',to:'B',h:'Falls back to another model',p:'Opus 5.5 uses the same biology safeguards as Fable 5.1, which fall back to another model transparently.',u:'Unlock path: vetted organizations can apply to the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/news/life-sciences-verification-program&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Life Sciences Verification Program&lt;/a&gt;.'},\n    {n:'Edit prior context via API',to:'C',h:'Preserved thinking stops the edit',p:'This anti-distillation safeguard stops API users from editing Claude\\'s prior context to extract its reasoning.',u:'Applies to API accounts created on or after August 31, 2026. See the &lt;a href=&quot;https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/preserved-thinking&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;preserved thinking docs&lt;/a&gt;.'}\n  ];\n  var curR=0, rch=document.getElementById('rchips'), dot=document.getElementById('dot'), raf=null;\n  R.forEach(function(r,i){var c=document.createElement('button');c.className='chip';c.textContent=r.n;c.setAttribute('aria-pressed',i===0);c.addEventListener('click',function(){curR=i;runRoute(i);});rch.appendChild(c);});\n  function setOn(ids){['nR','nS','nA','nB','nC','w0','wA','wB','wC'].forEach(function(id){document.getElementById(id).classList.toggle('on',ids.indexOf(id)&gt;-1);});}\n  function runRoute(i){\n    var r=R[i];\n    [].slice.call(rch.children).forEach(function(c,k){c.setAttribute('aria-pressed',k===i)});\n    document.getElementById('oh').textContent=r.h;\n    document.getElementById('op').textContent=r.p;\n    var ou=document.getElementById('ou');ou.innerHTML=r.u;ou.hidden=!r.u;\n    var w0=document.getElementById('w0'), w1=document.getElementById('w'+r.to);\n    var finalOn=['nR','nS','w0','w'+r.to,'n'+r.to];\n    if(raf)cancelAnimationFrame(raf);\n    if(reduce){setOn(finalOn);var e=w1.getPointAtLength(w1.getTotalLength());dot.setAttribute('cx',e.x);dot.setAttribute('cy',e.y);dot.setAttribute('opacity',1);setTimeout(resize,60);return;}\n    setOn(['nR']);dot.setAttribute('opacity',1);\n    var L0=w0.getTotalLength(), L1=w1.getTotalLength(), dur=1300, t0=null;\n    function step(ts){\n      if(!t0)t0=ts;var k=Math.min(1,(ts-t0)/dur), d=k*(L0+L1), pt;\n      if(d&lt;=L0){pt=w0.getPointAtLength(d);if(k&gt;0.05)setOn(['nR','w0']);}\n      else{pt=w1.getPointAtLength(d-L0);setOn(['nR','nS','w0','w'+r.to]);}\n      dot.setAttribute('cx',pt.x);dot.setAttribute('cy',pt.y);\n      if(k&lt;1)raf=requestAnimationFrame(step);else setOn(finalOn);\n    }\n    raf=requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    setTimeout(resize,60);\n  }\n\n  applyPreset(pre[0]);\n  drawBench(0);\n  window.addEventListener('load',resize);\n  window.addEventListener('resize',resize);\n  if(window.ResizeObserver)new ResizeObserver(resize).observe(document.body);\n  resize();\n})();\n&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\n\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-key-takeaways\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>Opus 5.5 matches Fable 5.1 on most work and beats both Opus 5 and Fable 5.1 on nearly every reported benchmark.</li>\n   <li>API pricing drops to $4/$20 per 1M tokens, and cache reads fall 60% to $0.20.</li>\n   <li>Anthropic puts typical workload savings at 40%, with output over 30% faster than Opus 5.</li>\n   <li>Cyber and biology requests hit Fable 5.1-class safeguards, and thinking cannot be switched off.</li>\n   <li>Closed weights: <code>claude-opus-5-5</code> runs via Claude Platform, AWS, Google Cloud, and Azure.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check out the <strong><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-opus-5-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Technical details here</a></strong>. All credit goes to the researcher of this project. Also,&nbsp;feel free to follow us on&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=marktechpost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Twitter</mark></a></strong>&nbsp;and don’t forget to join our&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/machinelearningnews/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">150k+ML SubReddit</a></strong>&nbsp;and Subscribe to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/f5e63dd4-5653-4f09-83e2-321a8b1ba526?email={{email}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">our Newsletter</a></strong>. Wait! are you on telegram?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://t.me/machinelearningresearchnews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">now you can join us on telegram as well.</a></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Need to partner with us for promoting your GitHub Repo OR Hugging Face Page OR Product Release OR Webinar etc.?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://forms.gle/MJjjVDPS7whH8Ngs6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Connect with us</mark></a></strong></p>\n  <!-- MOLONGUI AUTHORSHIP PLUGIN 5.2.12 -->\n  <!-- https://www.molongui.com/wordpress-plugin-post-authors -->\n  <div class=\"m-a-box \" data-box-layout=\"slim\" data-box-position=\"below\" data-multiauthor=\"false\" data-author-id=\"1\" data-author-type=\"user\" data-author-archived=\"\">\n   <div class=\"m-a-box-container\">\n    <div class=\"m-a-box-tab m-a-box-content m-a-box-profile\" data-profile-layout=\"layout-1\" data-author-ref=\"user-1\" itemscope itemid=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n     <div class=\"m-a-box-content-middle\">\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-avatar\" data-source=\"local\">\n       <a class=\"m-a-box-avatar-url\" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-150 photo\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png 150w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-80x80.png 80w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-24x24.png 24w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-48x48.png 48w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-96x96.png 96w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/